    {"name":"topmostSubform[0].Page1[0].TagcorrectingSubform[0].c1_1[0]","type":"checkbox","page":0,"rect":{"x":539.4,"y":133,"width":10,"height":10},"maxLen":null,"comb":false,"onValue":"1","speak":"Part I I I. Foreign Accounts and Trusts. Caution: If required, failure to file F i n C E N Form 114 may result in substantial penalties. Additionally, you may be required to file Form 8938, Statement of Specified Foreign Financial Assets. See instructions. You must complete this part if you (a) had over $1,500 of taxable interest or ordinary dividends; (b) had a foreign account; or (c) received a distribution from, or were a grantor of, or a transferor to, a foreign trust. 7a. At any time during 2025, did you have a financial interest in or signature authority over a financial account (such as a bank account, securities account, or brokerage account) located in a foreign country? See instructions. Yes."},
